Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:20:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/17] SystemUI: put the Duo blur in the overlay's first frame

addOverlay only queues the view, so the immediate setBackgroundBlurRadius
found no valid surface and returned false. The inner screen turned on
sharp, the cover reveal flashed sharp before jumping to full blur, and the
dump reported blurAvailable=false as if Battery Saver were on. Pass the
initial radius into addOverlay and set it on the relayout transaction that
carries the first frame, before ready is reported.
